Title: Japan 22-31 Wales: Fly-half Dan Edwards praises character after elusive win
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Dan Edwards', 'Text': '"It was about getting a win, I\'m absolutely chuffed," said Edwards.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 54}}, {'Speaker': 'Dan Edwards', 'Text': '"Especially with everyone saying we didn\'t deserve to win last week and were writing us off, people have been writing us off for however long.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 120}}, {'Speaker': 'Dan Edwards', 'Text': '"We\'ve come back and shown everyone why we\'re here. It shows the character we\'ve got. That was a real statement that when it gets tough, we can pull through.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 132}}, {'Speaker': 'Dan Edwards', 'Text': '"It\'s also just that little bit of a boost that Welsh rugby needed."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 62}}, {'Speaker': 'Dan Edwards', 'Text': '"Fair play to Taine, he was brave doing that," said Edwards', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 49}}, {'Speaker': 'Dan Edwards', 'Text': '"It was great just getting on the end of it and finishing it off."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 58}}, {'Speaker': 'Taine Plumtree', 'Text': '"It was just one of the main messages that Jockey [Wales interim head coach Matt Sherratt] gave us was to be brave and express ourselves," said Plumtree.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 14, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 130}}, {'Speaker': 'Taine Plumtree', 'Text': '"I think we were under an advantage. I heard Rog [Wales wing Tom Rogers] out the back so I pulled it back. Thank God it came through."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 15, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 115}}, {'Speaker': 'Matt Sherratt', 'Text': '"That last play summarises it for me," said Sherratt.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 17, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 47}}, {'Speaker': 'Matt Sherratt', 'Text': '"It would have been easy to go to a safe lineout at the front. We have thrown to the back, run a more risky play.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 18, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 96}}, {'Speaker': 'Matt Sherratt', 'Text': '"And Taine Plumtree throws a reverse pass. I didn\'t intend for him to be that brave, but it worked!"', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 19, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 88}}, {'Speaker': 'Taine Plumtree', 'Text': '"As those bench players, you\'ve got to bring energy to those starters," said Plumtree.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 21, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 73}}, {'Speaker': 'Taine Plumtree', 'Text': '"You know the heat is incredible. It\'s tough being out there.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 22, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 57}}, {'Speaker': 'Taine Plumtree', 'Text': '"One of the jobs for us is bringing that level and trying to bring the boys up to finish off the game."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 23, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 92}}, {'Speaker': 'Keelan Giles', 'Text': '"It\'s a massive day for me and my family," said Giles.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 32, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 48}}, {'Speaker': 'Keelan Giles', 'Text': '"They made the trip over, which made it extra special. It\'s unbelievable.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 33, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 66}}, {'Speaker': 'Keelan Giles', 'Text': '"It\'s been a long time coming. It\'s almost like a full-circle moment, playing against Japan and being on the bench nine years ago against Japan and not getting on.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 34, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 133}}, {'Speaker': 'Keelan Giles', 'Text': '"So it\'s an extra special feeling."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 35, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 33}}, {'Speaker': 'Keelan Giles', 'Text': '"I just wanted to get on the pitch no matter how many minutes I played," said Giles.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 37, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 76}}, {'Speaker': 'Keelan Giles', 'Text': '"A win has been a long time coming for fans of Wales. This group has worked extremely hard over the last couple of years.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 38, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 107}}, {'Speaker': 'Keelan Giles', 'Text': '"To get that win, it\'s almost the monkey off our backs. It\'s something to build on now.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 39, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 80}}, {'Speaker': 'Keelan Giles', 'Text': '"The players have been feeling it, with 18 losses, the players felt it the most.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 40, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 68}}, {'Speaker': 'Keelan Giles', 'Text': '"Now it\'s time to kick on and get more wins. We\'re looking forward to the autumn and the future."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 41, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 84}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Wales fly-half Dan Edwards says the tourists proved their character by defeating Japan in Kobe.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 81}}, {'Description': 'Ospreys fly-half Edwards, 22, scored a crucial late try after some magic from replacement flanker Taine Plumtree who produced an outrageous reverse pass.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 125}}, {'Description': 'Plumtree came on for Cardiff flanker Alex Mann and was one of the second-half replacements who made an impact in the Kobe heat and humidity.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 20, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 109}}, {'Description': 'Giles came on as a half-time replacement for the injured Josh Adams, who had scored a try and created one in the first half.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 36, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 108}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Dan Edwards tackles a Japan attacker'}]}
